Package: vpndetection
Type: Package
Title: Client for the 'VPNDetection' API
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Uman", "Shahzad", email = "uman@vpndetection.io", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Mslm Dev", role = "cph"))
Description: Looks up whether an IP address belongs to a VPN, a residential,
    datacenter, mobile or public proxy, a hosting provider, a Tor node, a
    content delivery network or a relay, through the 'VPNDetection' API
    <https://vpndetection.io>. Reserved addresses are answered locally, answers
    are cached per client, a batch of any size is sent in chunks the API
    accepts, and failed requests are retried as the API's 'Retry-After' asks.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://vpndetection.io, https://docs.vpndetection.io,
    https://github.com/vpndetection-io/sdk-r
BugReports: https://github.com/vpndetection-io/sdk-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    curl (>= 5.0.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.8),
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    webfakes (>= 1.3.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
